        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eng’eria Y’obong’aini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, ancha amang’ana ane, ogache amachiiko ane ase enkoro yao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde oigwe obong’aini, naende orue enkoro yao ebe nokomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obe gokorangeria korigia chiseemi, naende osorore onyore okomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Origie obong’aini buna okorigia chifeta, oboriga‐rigie buna okoriga‐rigia chinibo chibisire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oise gokora bo, rirorio nomanye komoiroka Omonene, naende nigo oranyaare komomanya Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nere okoa abanto obong’aini; chiseemi na okomanya nigo bikorwa ase omonwa oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abare ne chinkoro chindonge Omonene nigo abagacherete obong’aini oboikeranu. Ere nigo are enguba ase abanto abwo bagotaara ase oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo arendete chiinchera chi’abagokora ekeene, naende orenda chiinchera chi’abamoirogete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koranyigwere, rirorio nomanye ayaare boronge na ekeene, na ayagwenerete: ee, nomanye chiinchera chionsi chire chingiya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na obong’aini ’mbosoe ase enkoro yao, ne chiseemi nigo chiragokie omoyo oo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeroberio y’ebirengererio ebiya nekorende, na okomanya okuya ’ngokorende boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini ’mbokorusie korwa ase chiinchera chi’obobe na korwa ase abanto bagokwana amang’ana y’obosiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo nigo bagotiga chiinchera chi’oboronge, babwatia chiinchera chi’omosunte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bakogookera ase ogokora amabe, naende bagookera chingencho chi’oborubanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinchera chiabo nigo chire chinkorekanu, nigo bagotaara ase chiinchera chire borogochi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini obwo ’mbogokonye kwebachera omokungu onde bwensi omotayayi, oyio ogokwana amang’ana ogweansia korwa ase omonwa oye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyio otigire omwanchi bw’oboke bwaye, naende bwebire okobwatana kw’ogotianania kwa Nyasae oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere amo nab’enyomba yaye nigo bagotirimboka gochia ase amakweri, ne chiinchera chiaye nigo chikobaraa gochia aase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde bwensi ogochiera omokungu oyio tari koirana naende, takoiranera chiinchera chi’obogima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, obwatie enchera y’abanto abaya, na otaare ase oboeto bw’abanyaboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera abare ne chinkoro chindonge ’mbamenye ase ense, na abaikeranu ’mbageenderere komenya aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abakori amabe ’mbaitwe barue ase ense, na abasaria ’mbasirigwe kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
